-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 5. thanh_toan - 161 giao dich thu tien
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Sinh bang cach goi ThanhToanService.ghiNhan() that qua cac lop seed tam,
-- hat giong co dinh, nguoi thu la ketoan01. Ty le thu GIAM DAN theo do moi
-- cua ky - do la hinh dang cong no that:
--
--   ky 3/2026  58 giao dich  80% tra du /  5% tra mot phan  (hat giong 20260401)
--   ky 4/2026  55 giao dich  70% tra du / 10% tra mot phan  (hat giong 20260501)
--   ky 5/2026  48 giao dich  60% tra du / 15% tra mot phan  (hat giong 20260601)
--
-- Trong nhom tra du, cu 4 hoa don thi 1 hoa don tra LAM HAI DOT - de tab
-- lich su thu tien co hoa don nhieu dong, va de duong cong don
-- da_thanh_toan += soTien that su duoc di qua chu khong chi duoc viet ra.
--
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
-- KY 6 VA KY 7 CO Y KHONG CO GIAO DICH NAO - dung xoa dong ghi chu nay
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
-- BillingService.huyBillingKy() TU CHOI xoa hoa don cua mot ky da ghi nhan
-- thanh toan: cac giao dich do se tro vao hoa don khong con ton tai. Ba ky
-- 3, 4, 5 da thu tien nen khoa han kha nang huy; giu ky 6 va ky 7 sach giao
-- dich la de con ky demo duoc tron vong "huy hoa don -> lap lai".
--
-- Them mot giao dich cho hai ky do la mat kha nang do, va no khong hien ra
-- ngay - chi lo ra dung luc dang demo.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
